{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div style=\"float:right\">\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2007_CyMO-14.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/b/b8/2007_CyMO-14.PNG/250px-2007_CyMO-14.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"243\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/b/b8/2007_CyMO-14.PNG/375px-2007_CyMO-14.PNG 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/b/b8/2007_CyMO-14.PNG/500px-2007_CyMO-14.PNG 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>In square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> the segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/a/a5a637daf4f6186252b9391561bd15736b21d38e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$KB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> equals a side of the square. The ratio of areas <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/d/40d8ea38f7643506b946b9ef5d8153cf67a8fc3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{S_1}{S_2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"21\" height=\"40\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/8/578f66018c4b3a450383a5d72b1db77565ba8e63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } \\frac{1}{3}\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } \\frac{2}{3}\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } \\sqrt2-1\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"433\" height=\"45\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c637022b2d43c4bcd447a7b5b6e6efa2374c58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle KBC$\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/a/35a21106704cc9701205c388be42ed2ef784d094.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle KCD$\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" /> have the same heights (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/2/672fa74d5e438a4e4f3097892fa2678da5683e5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\perp BD$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />), so the ratio of their areas is simply the ratio of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/b/31bd5828e708bdb05523f941bf70c054294bb76b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$KD:KB$\" width=\"78\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Let the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/a/a5a637daf4f6186252b9391561bd15736b21d38e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$KB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/7/387439086828dbeb64b0bdc94e0b1e11dda975ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$KD=x\\sqrt{2}-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />, and the ratio of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/4/424ebaede6e376af9ac08c3670aba71ae1090ba6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1:S_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/8/1b8c38c76dfa7cff3e5a424fa1b8c6745788530b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\sqrt{2}-x:x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/0/5a0d06d6544920ab5a9827b59b7bba9624b29875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{2}-1:1\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"132\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_13\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_15\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/